{"section": 103, "en": "\\bBeni: It seems my ninja techniques will soon be consigned to history...", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 310}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rZisu: Hey! Did you need something from me?", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 311}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rZisu: Captain Zisu of the Security Corps, reporting for duty!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 311}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rZisu: Take all the time you need to think it through.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 311}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bKamado: Hrrm. Would you like me to accompany you?", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 312}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bKamado: Hrrm! I shall lend you my strength.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 312}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bKamado: Hrrm. Very well.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 312}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rIrida: Let's explore a world we've never seen before!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 313}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rIrida: Great choice! You won't regret it!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 313}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rIrida: See you!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 313}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bAdaman: I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 314}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bAdaman: You can count on me.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 314}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bAdaman: See ya later!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 314}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rCyllene: You may use my assistance.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 315}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rCyllene: Let's go.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 315}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rCyllene: I'll allow it.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 315}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rAkari: Show me how you make a heart-to-heart connection with Pokémon!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 316}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rAkari: Okay! Let's do this together!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 316}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rAkari: I'll see you later.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 316}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bRei: I still don't know much about this place... mind if I team up with you?", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 317}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bRei: Great. I'll show you my skills!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 317}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bRei: Okay. See ya.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 317}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bLaventon: Shall we help each other out?", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 318}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bLaventon: Well, that's smashing!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 318}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bLaventon: Ah, I suppose that can happen.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 318}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rCogita: Oh my, would you like to utilise the power of Sinnoh's myths and legends?", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 319}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rCogita: Very well.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 319}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rCogita: On with you, then.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 319}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bVolo: I'll fight to seize my dream, even if I must do it alone!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 320}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bVolo: Very well. I'll lend you my power.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 320}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bVolo: Until next time.", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 320}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\bBrock: My Pokémon and I are rock-hard with true-grit determination!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 441}
{"section": 103, "en": "\\rMisty: We'll show you an elegant battle!", "script": "Grandeur Club", "line": 442}
